# C2 rope oracle (tools/probes/client/c2-beams/README.md): dm_lockdown, the
# viewer parked under the shower cables (four spans, all inside rope_wind_dist
# of the view, so the gust wind is on), looking up at them so BuildRope runs.
wait iface-list 120
cmd map dm_lockdown
wait first paint 240
cmd sv_cheats 1
cmd setpos_exact -3800 2500 120
cmd setang_exact -40 30 0
sleep 3
shot ropes
sleep 12
shot ropes-late
cmd disconnect
sleep 2
quit
